"flat 2D hand-drawn animation cel composited into a richly detailed painterly semi-realistic 3D environment with cinematic lighting, volumetric fog, depth of field, and strong foreground-background separation"

GOOD PROMPT (SD renders this well):
"cartoon character with round white head, dot eyes, yellow beanie, teal shirt, standing in colorful town square, warm afternoon sun, detailed buildings, medium shot, digital painting style"

RULES FOR NARRATION:
- Dry, deadpan, matter-of-fact tone
- 2-3 short punchy sentences per scene
- Present tense for immediacy
